@startuml usecase
title COLORS Web Application - Use Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
  usecase "Log In\n--\nextension points:\ncredentials rejected" as LogIn
  usecase "Show Login Error" as LoginError
  usecase "Search Colors" as Search
  usecase "Add Color" as Add
  usecase "Verify Session" as Verify
  usecase "Log Out" as LogOut
}

User -- LogIn
User -- Search
User -- Add
User -- LogOut

Search ..> Verify : <<include>>
Add ..> Verify : <<include>>
LoginError ..> LogIn : <<extend>>

note right of Verify
  color.html reads the session cookie on load.
  No cookie (or an expired one) sends the user
  back to index.html. Search and Add both send
  the userId stored in that cookie.
end note

note bottom of User
  There is no sign-up page. Accounts are
  added directly to the Users table in MySQL.
end note
@enduml
